  "reason": "The exact diamond alpha contract and cave limestone palette pass. The dark winding crack and gray shoulder, however, traverse most of the diamond and intrude into the quiet upper-left rim, reading at tile scale as a route or near-spanning seam rather than a restrained interior accent. The warm off-center feature is a dense raised pile of individually highlighted amber rubble, introducing obstacle semantics into a collision-none surface family and competing with overlays. The replacement must keep cracks lower-contrast and away from the rim and render the warm island as diffuse flat mineral material.",
